      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Seeing how Lyova united the cooks against a common problem, Max comes up with one last plan to end Sasha and Nastya's feud. Right in front of the bar, Max and Kostya pretend to quarrel over their girlfriends and step outside for a staged fistfight.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Костян, у меня есть еще одна идея.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Нет, уж, знаешь, хватит с меня твоих идей.",
